      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 2,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 14.3,
      "EndSecond": 15.7,
      "OriginalText": "Wow War Alive",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 3,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 15.8,
      "EndSecond": 20.9,
      "OriginalText": "You say we've been through a lot up till now",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 4,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 21,
      "EndSecond": 25.8,
      "OriginalText": "So I fondly looked at some of those old archives",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 5,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 25.9,
      "EndSecond": 36.6,
      "OriginalText": "Sometimes it was boring, but sometimes it all went by in a flash; what a long, strange journey",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 6,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 36.7,
      "EndSecond": 41.7,
      "OriginalText": "It doesn't matter what kind of hardships await us",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 7,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 41.8,
      "EndSecond": 46.4,
      "OriginalText": "Don't go timing it on that analogue wristwatch of yours",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 8,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 46.5,
      "EndSecond": 57.3,
      "OriginalText": "After all, time is merciless, because it only pulls what's precious ever further away",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 9,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 57.4,
      "EndSecond": 59.8,
      "OriginalText": "I look at my foes and strike them down",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 10,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 59.9,
      "EndSecond": 62.7,
      "OriginalText": "I look at you and search for meaning",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 11,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 62.8,
      "EndSecond": 67.9,
      "OriginalText": "Even if it's gone in a heartbeat, that's the kind of romantic love this is",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 12,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 68,
      "EndSecond": 70.5,
      "OriginalText": "I take a breath and come back to my senses",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 13,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 70.6,
      "EndSecond": 73,
      "OriginalText": "And find myself hurting and desperate",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 14,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 73.1,
      "EndSecond": 78.1,
      "OriginalText": "Even if they're gone in a heartbeat, those are the years we spent together",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 15,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 78.2,
      "EndSecond": 80.8,
      "OriginalText": "Don't leave me just yet",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 16,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 80.9,
      "EndSecond": 90.2,
      "OriginalText": "Wow Wow Wow Wow...",
